WEBVTT

00:11.310 --> 00:13.120
Fulfe! Is the baby...

00:13.820 --> 00:17.080
Congratulations. It's a healthy baby girl.

00:17.780 --> 00:19.670
You did so well, Fulfe!

00:19.670 --> 00:23.380
Dear, will you give her a name?

00:23.380 --> 00:24.440
Yes.

00:25.210 --> 00:28.920
We'll name this child Femicia.

00:30.760 --> 00:33.750
Femicia? What a lovely name.

00:35.580 --> 00:40.020
It's nice to meet you, Femicia. 
I'm your mother.

00:40.020 --> 00:45.020
<b>Toward Those Remembered Days</b>

01:02.170 --> 01:10.420
<b>The Weakest Tamer
Began a Journey
to Pick Up Trash</b>

02:21.500 --> 02:22.670
Father!

02:22.670 --> 02:24.310
Big Brother!

02:25.300 --> 02:27.460
I brought your lunch!

02:29.420 --> 02:31.130
Good work, Femicia.

02:31.380 --> 02:32.610
I'll come right down.

02:42.400 --> 02:44.690
Hey, are you all right?

02:47.730 --> 02:48.750
Here.

02:49.450 --> 02:50.910
Don't get flustered.

02:51.720 --> 02:54.180
It's because you try to
wolf it down. It's unseemly.

02:54.180 --> 02:56.420
I'm growing! I need to eat lots!

02:57.890 --> 03:01.330
That's right, Femicia. 
Eat lots and grow up big and strong!

03:01.330 --> 03:02.340
I will!

03:02.340 --> 03:04.940
Father, you're always 
so lenient with Femicia.

03:08.060 --> 03:09.590
I'm home!

03:09.590 --> 03:11.140
Welcome back.

03:11.570 --> 03:14.550
Welcome back, Femicia. 
Will you set the table for me?

03:14.550 --> 03:15.590
Yes!

03:16.950 --> 03:20.260
Femicia, you need to hurry up 
and start using everyday magic.

03:20.810 --> 03:23.250
I'm going to be able to use it soon!

03:23.250 --> 03:25.710
There's no need to rush, Femicia.

03:25.710 --> 03:28.380
Everyone develops at their own pace.

03:28.380 --> 03:31.820
Even now, you're very good at helping out. 
That's very admirable.

03:31.820 --> 03:34.510
That's not what you said to me
when I was four years old!

03:34.510 --> 03:38.000
You always wished I'd hurry up and
be able to use everyday magic already.

03:38.000 --> 03:39.780
The youngest gets special treatment, huh?

03:39.780 --> 03:41.370
Is that really how it was?

03:41.370 --> 03:45.240
Here. It's everyone's favorite, nonoshi stew.

03:45.240 --> 03:46.460
It looks so good!

03:46.760 --> 03:49.700
And since Fecilla, who has the 
soothing skill, helped make it,

03:49.700 --> 03:51.430
it'll make my fatigue vanish!

03:51.430 --> 03:52.920
Good work today, everyone!

03:53.460 --> 03:54.920
Now, eat up!

04:02.140 --> 04:03.950
How is your work faring?

04:03.950 --> 04:08.390
The house just needs one last push. 
It should be done by the end of the month.

04:08.390 --> 04:10.560
The furniture should be done this week.

04:10.560 --> 04:14.410
Really? I'd expect no less of someone 
with a three-star furniture making skill.

04:14.410 --> 04:18.050
It's all thanks to you finishing the cushions 
for the sofa so quickly, Mother.

04:18.050 --> 04:21.460
Yes, well, I do have a two-star sewing skill.

04:24.090 --> 04:25.490
What's wrong?

04:26.950 --> 04:28.910
I'm sorry for startling you.

04:28.910 --> 04:32.140
I'm stitching the bridal wear 
for the shoemaker's daughter,

04:32.140 --> 04:33.710
and it made me realize that one day

04:33.710 --> 04:36.130
Fecilla and you, Femicia, 
will go off to be brides, too.

04:36.130 --> 04:39.340
Make my dress incredibly fancy, won't you?

04:39.340 --> 04:41.300
That's still a ways away.

04:41.550 --> 04:43.970
No, it'll be here before we know it.

04:43.970 --> 04:47.070
You're right. Femicia is already 
almost five, after all.

04:47.070 --> 04:49.640
Yes! I can't wait for my birthday presents!

04:49.640 --> 04:51.160
That isn't the thing to be excited for!

04:51.160 --> 04:54.800
When you turn five, you'll receive 
something even more important, won't you?

04:54.800 --> 04:56.190
Huh? Oh!

04:56.540 --> 04:58.230
That's right. Your skill.

04:59.270 --> 05:02.390
Everyone receives a skill 
when they turn five.

05:02.810 --> 05:06.250
As long as you have a skill, 
you'll always find a place to work

05:06.250 --> 05:08.020
and have a way to earn your next meal.

05:08.020 --> 05:11.750
What sort of skill and 
how many stars it is, well,

05:11.750 --> 05:13.930
no one knows that 
until they receive their skill.

05:13.930 --> 05:15.710
The only ones who know are the gods.

05:15.710 --> 05:19.560
The type of skill and number of stars 
will determine where you work,

05:19.560 --> 05:21.660
so it's awfully important.

05:21.660 --> 05:25.350
That's right. If you have three stars, 
like I do, then you're quite secure,

05:25.350 --> 05:29.800
but if you've only got one star, like Fecilla's 
soothing skill, your life's done for.

05:29.800 --> 05:32.100
What did you just say?

05:32.100 --> 05:34.350
Now, now. Let's all get along.

05:34.350 --> 05:37.320
Femicia, what kind of skill do you want?

05:37.320 --> 05:41.030
I... want to be a tamer!

05:41.290 --> 05:47.370
I'll be a tamer and be friends with dragons 
and griffons and all kinds of monsters!

05:48.620 --> 05:50.130
That's so dumb!

05:50.130 --> 05:51.370
Why?!

05:51.860 --> 05:54.830
Skills are abilities that are needed 
so that you can work.

05:54.830 --> 05:59.840
They're capabilities bestowed by the gods, 
enabling us to live in this world.

06:00.380 --> 06:02.660
Making friends with them isn't enough.

06:04.090 --> 06:05.700
But, in place of that...

06:06.230 --> 06:07.300
here.

06:09.020 --> 06:10.940
Isn't that wonderful, Femicia?

06:10.940 --> 06:12.150
Yes!

06:13.140 --> 06:15.660
Who could it be at this hour?

06:15.980 --> 06:17.700
Who's there?

06:19.100 --> 06:21.290
Oh, Mistress Luba!

06:21.290 --> 06:23.530
Pardon me for coming so late at night.

06:24.860 --> 06:29.650
I realized that it's nearly time 
for Femicia to be gifted with her skill,

06:29.650 --> 06:32.080
so I've come to offer 
a prayer of good fortune.

06:32.370 --> 06:34.800
Thank you for going to all this trouble.

06:34.800 --> 06:36.330
Please, come inside.

06:41.890 --> 06:44.510
Oh, so this is Femicia?

06:44.510 --> 06:46.380
She's grown so much.

06:46.380 --> 06:50.970
Yes. Since she turned two, 
she's started speaking well, too.

06:50.970 --> 06:54.960
It's just... sometimes she 
says strange things.

06:54.960 --> 06:56.820
That's why I've asked you 
to come, Mistress Luba.

06:56.820 --> 06:58.150
Strange things?

06:59.250 --> 07:01.910
My husband says I'm making too much of it,

07:01.910 --> 07:04.300
but I'm worried about whether 
she'll be able to use magic or not.

07:04.300 --> 07:07.410
Magic? This world has magic?

07:08.290 --> 07:11.370
Yes, and you'll be able to use it, too!

07:11.370 --> 07:13.370
Yay!

07:13.370 --> 07:15.330
What? "Reincarnated into another world"?

07:15.330 --> 07:16.660
You see? She's doing it again.

07:16.660 --> 07:19.630
Missus Fulfe, there's no need to worry.

07:19.630 --> 07:23.340
Femicia will surely grow into 
a very intelligent child.

07:23.340 --> 07:27.090
But while I'm here, shall I read her fortune?

07:27.090 --> 07:31.070
May I borrow a candle? 
A new one if possible.

07:31.070 --> 07:34.150
Thank you so much. 
Please wait just a moment.

07:38.640 --> 07:41.680
You have memories 
of your past life, don't you?

07:41.680 --> 07:42.730
Past life?

07:42.730 --> 07:46.040
If people learn that you have 
memories of your past life,

07:46.040 --> 07:48.260
it will make things very difficult for you.

07:48.260 --> 07:50.510
So, you mustn't tell anyone about them.

07:50.510 --> 07:53.130
Keep it a secret, even from 
your mother. Can you do that?

07:53.130 --> 07:55.410
Can you promise me?

07:55.410 --> 07:57.870
Yes! It's a promise!

08:00.690 --> 08:02.960
I've finished the prayer.

08:02.960 --> 08:07.520
Femicia is sure to be gifted 
with a wonderful skill.

08:07.520 --> 08:09.190
Thank you so much.

08:09.190 --> 08:13.890
Mistress Luba, could a fortune 
show you what skill she'll get?

08:13.890 --> 08:18.480
Mine is only a one-star foresight skill, 
so I can't see quite so far.

08:19.090 --> 08:21.740
With only one star, you can't really help it.

08:22.090 --> 08:24.010
Stop that! Watch your mouth!

08:24.010 --> 08:27.030
It's thanks to Mistress Luba 
that this village can carry on!

08:27.370 --> 08:31.510
Without her predictions, we wouldn't
be able to harvest the zaro fruit.

08:31.510 --> 08:33.990
I'm sorry. He's still a child.

08:39.170 --> 08:43.650
Today, this one young life shall, 
with the blessing of the gods,

08:43.650 --> 08:46.640
be gifted the power to obtain 
sustenance throughout their life.

08:46.640 --> 08:48.920
Through this sacred power,

08:48.920 --> 08:53.120
the joy of hard work, the happiness 
at the wonder of living,

08:53.120 --> 08:56.200
and the divine protection of truth 
are promised to you.

08:56.200 --> 08:57.240
Now, then.

09:14.890 --> 09:16.550
O, gods!

09:16.550 --> 09:19.910
By your love and compassion, 
gift unto this unblemished spirit

09:19.910 --> 09:22.870
the power to earn their sustenance!

09:30.180 --> 09:32.260
We have received our divine message.

09:32.750 --> 09:37.650
This girl possesses the tamer skill, 
the ability to win monsters over to her.

09:38.290 --> 09:39.470
A tamer!

09:41.390 --> 09:43.790
And the number of stars...

09:46.940 --> 09:48.320
This is...

09:55.580 --> 09:57.080
No stars?!

09:57.540 --> 10:00.790
This child possesses a starless tamer skill!

10:00.790 --> 10:01.920
That can't be.

10:01.920 --> 10:03.900
There must be some mistake!

10:03.900 --> 10:05.610
My daughter can't be starless!

10:05.610 --> 10:08.600
This is a divine message! 
A mistake simply isn't possible!

10:08.600 --> 10:09.460
But—

10:09.460 --> 10:13.590
Speak any further on this 
and you blaspheme the gods!

10:13.590 --> 10:15.360
Oh, how horrifying.

10:15.360 --> 10:17.120
The fact that a starless has been born...

10:17.120 --> 10:19.990
The fact that one abandoned 
by the gods has appeared...

10:23.890 --> 10:26.060
<i>Huh? "Impossibly hard video game"?</i>

10:28.510 --> 10:29.980
What does it mean?!

10:35.670 --> 10:37.460
Dear, I think you've already had—

10:37.830 --> 10:39.840
Both you and I have stars.

10:39.840 --> 10:42.830
Our older son and daughter 
have stars, so why...

10:42.830 --> 10:44.790
why is it that Femicia alone doesn't?

10:46.040 --> 10:46.930
Father?

10:46.930 --> 10:47.790
Don't speak!

10:48.630 --> 10:51.000
The starless have been abandoned by the gods.

10:51.000 --> 10:53.720
Why is there a starless in my family?

10:55.400 --> 10:56.330
What?

10:56.330 --> 10:59.010
Dear, there's no need to go that far.

10:59.860 --> 11:01.220
Dear...

11:01.690 --> 11:04.060
It's not possible that a starless 
could come from my family.

11:04.540 --> 11:06.850
How is that possible?

11:07.770 --> 11:09.400
What's the point of being a tamer?

11:10.400 --> 11:12.860
With no stars, it's completely useless!

11:13.300 --> 11:14.340
Why?

11:14.820 --> 11:17.720
Why was this starless born?

11:18.160 --> 11:22.200
Is Femicia... really my child?

11:26.850 --> 11:28.090
Mother?

11:28.090 --> 11:29.070
Don't touch her!

11:29.700 --> 11:30.530
Ow!

11:30.530 --> 11:32.230
That hurts, Big Brother!

11:32.230 --> 11:33.170
Big Sister?

11:35.760 --> 11:38.970
It hurts, Big Brother! Please, stop!

11:40.430 --> 11:41.890
Get out!

11:48.590 --> 11:50.700
They say that child is starless.

11:50.700 --> 11:53.230
That's the child that's been 
abandoned by the gods, isn't it?

11:54.150 --> 11:56.860
A starless has appeared in Latomi, our village!

11:57.280 --> 12:01.250
It is a horrible thing. It must be 
an omen of disasters to come!

12:01.250 --> 12:04.120
Let us all gather and prepare 
against misfortune!

12:04.120 --> 12:06.750
Let us devote our abilities 
to the good of the village!

12:06.750 --> 12:09.290
That's right! Protect Latomi!

12:09.290 --> 12:10.400
Starless!

12:10.400 --> 12:12.710
You don't belong here, starless!

12:30.360 --> 12:32.550
<i>Why? Why?</i>

12:42.660 --> 12:46.370
I... can't go home anymore.

12:47.910 --> 12:49.210
"A witch hunt"?

12:50.320 --> 12:52.480
But I'm not a witch.

12:59.280 --> 13:01.230
<i>I'm hungry.</i>

13:21.300 --> 13:23.010
It's so cold.

13:29.540 --> 13:31.310
I wonder if I can do it.

13:40.660 --> 13:42.090
One more time.

14:02.800 --> 14:04.160
Are you all right?

14:04.840 --> 14:06.490
Mistress Fortune Teller.

14:06.490 --> 14:10.190
It seems you have less magical 
energy than most people.

14:10.190 --> 14:13.480
If you run out of magical energy, 
it puts your life at risk,

14:13.480 --> 14:15.210
so you should be very careful.

14:16.150 --> 14:20.180
My foresight showed me 
that this would happen to you.

14:20.180 --> 14:23.930
But I wasn't able to see 
why you ended up this way.

14:24.200 --> 14:26.460
I never imagined that you'd be starless.

14:26.460 --> 14:27.350
Here.

14:42.170 --> 14:43.450
Do you feel better?

14:44.830 --> 14:46.800
Even with limited magical energy,

14:46.800 --> 14:50.120
with the right knowledge, it won't be 
as inconvenient as you might think.

14:53.130 --> 14:55.040
I'll give this to you.

14:55.700 --> 14:57.440
It's a magic bag.

14:57.750 --> 15:01.540
It's an old model, 
but lots of things fit in it,

15:01.540 --> 15:03.470
and whatever you put inside becomes lighter.

15:03.470 --> 15:07.170
And there are many things 
written in that book.

15:07.170 --> 15:10.950
As long as you're alive, I'm certain 
it will prove useful to you.

15:10.950 --> 15:13.720
Even when you one day set off on a journey.

15:14.160 --> 15:15.190
A journey?

15:15.520 --> 15:16.820
Yes.

15:16.820 --> 15:22.030
One day, you must take a journey to see 
the world and broaden your perspective.

15:22.030 --> 15:26.110
When you do, go to the town 
neighboring the royal capital.

15:26.110 --> 15:28.320
The town neighboring the royal capital?

15:28.680 --> 15:33.220
But if you find a place where you'd like 
to live forever while on your journey,

15:33.220 --> 15:35.520
there's no need to force yourself 
to keep traveling.

15:35.520 --> 15:39.030
However, you must find people 
that you can trust.

15:39.520 --> 15:42.500
When you do, you must tell them everything.

15:43.170 --> 15:45.410
Even that I'm starless?

15:45.410 --> 15:48.160
Everything hidden eventually comes to light.

15:48.160 --> 15:52.980
When that time comes, you'll need 
allies who will fight by your side.

15:52.980 --> 15:57.910
You see, secrets can become the reason 
people lose their trust in you.

15:57.910 --> 15:59.080
Why?

15:59.620 --> 16:02.910
Why are you so kind to me, 
Mistress Fortune Teller?

16:02.910 --> 16:05.120
Don't you hate me?

16:05.710 --> 16:07.870
Hate you?

16:07.870 --> 16:12.530
Everyone else does. They hate me 
because I'm starless.

16:12.530 --> 16:16.580
Long ago, no one had skills or stars.

16:16.580 --> 16:17.450
What?

16:17.450 --> 16:22.480
Even without skills, everyone 
worked and lived happy lives.

16:22.480 --> 16:24.310
Even without skills?

16:24.310 --> 16:28.840
That's right. Not having a skill 
isn't a bad thing.

16:28.840 --> 16:31.130
Then, why is it like this now?

16:31.130 --> 16:33.880
I don't know. I wonder why myself.

16:37.810 --> 16:39.980
<b>3 years later</b>

16:40.790 --> 16:43.170
There's lots of trash again today.

16:44.580 --> 16:47.400
I wonder if those are left over 
from Feton making furniture.

16:47.890 --> 16:51.410
They're nice and dry,
 so they'll make good firewood.

16:53.250 --> 16:55.070
A blue potion!

16:55.660 --> 16:57.870
These seem like they're 
just barely still usable.

16:57.870 --> 16:59.720
I've got a huge haul today!

17:03.680 --> 17:04.840
I caught it!

17:05.350 --> 17:08.680
Once I get used to them,
snares might be better than pitfalls.

17:08.680 --> 17:10.490
It's easier than digging pits, too.

17:15.460 --> 17:18.500
<i>The fortune teller hasn't come by lately.</i>

17:18.500 --> 17:20.880
<i>When was the last time I saw her?</i>

17:22.410 --> 17:23.760
<i>I sense a presence.</i>

17:23.760 --> 17:25.650
<i>It isn't a monster.</i>

17:26.210 --> 17:27.230
<i>A person?</i>

17:27.230 --> 17:28.360
<i>And they aren't alone!</i>

17:32.410 --> 17:34.550
<i>Why are there people here?</i>

17:36.210 --> 17:38.580
<i>Did something happen in the village?</i>

17:40.700 --> 17:42.840
<i>I have a bad feeling about this.</i>

17:46.920 --> 17:48.820
It's going to feel lonely.

17:48.820 --> 17:49.880
Yes, it will.

17:49.880 --> 17:52.400
We've lost someone very precious.

17:52.400 --> 17:55.270
Who could imagine dying 
of a cold at this time of year?

17:55.720 --> 17:58.130
And Mistress Luba was
 such a good person, too.

17:58.130 --> 18:00.800
I still can't believe it.

18:00.800 --> 18:03.440
<i>Mistress Fortune Teller... has died?</i>

18:06.580 --> 18:07.400
Village Head!

18:08.480 --> 18:11.810
My daughter... Femicia wasn't there.

18:11.810 --> 18:13.710
She should have been in the hideaway, but...

18:14.180 --> 18:15.870
She caught wind of us, did she?

18:16.650 --> 18:19.330
She'll bring misfortune to this village.

18:19.330 --> 18:22.660
Tablo, you understand what to do, don't you?

18:22.660 --> 18:24.290
Of course.

18:24.290 --> 18:28.130
The starless should not be 
allowed to exist in this world.

18:28.880 --> 18:32.350
And that girl will be returning to the gods,

18:32.350 --> 18:34.010
so she will surely be happy, too.

18:42.580 --> 18:45.480
Femicia. Femicia!

18:46.150 --> 18:50.280
It would have been better 
if you were never born.

18:52.460 --> 18:55.240
People of Latomi Village, listen to me!

18:55.240 --> 19:00.200
The fortune teller, Luba, 
was very important to our village.

19:00.600 --> 19:03.540
The cause of her death...

19:03.540 --> 19:05.040
was a curse!

19:05.040 --> 19:11.200
Fortune Teller Luba ignored my warnings 
and looked after the starless Femicia.

19:11.500 --> 19:16.720
Due to that, she received the curse of the 
starless, the ones forsaken by the gods!

19:16.970 --> 19:19.010
That girl is a calamity!

19:19.010 --> 19:22.470
Left unchecked, she will bring 
misfortune down upon our village!

19:22.470 --> 19:25.730
Find Femicia and capture her!

19:25.730 --> 19:27.760
We will kill that girl!

19:27.760 --> 19:31.290
We will kill her before she 
brings disaster to Latomi Village!

19:31.290 --> 19:32.820
Yeah!

19:42.240 --> 19:44.790
<i>Why? Why? Why?</i>

19:44.790 --> 19:46.830
<i>I didn't do anything wrong!</i>

19:46.830 --> 19:49.010
<i>The fortune teller didn't 
do anything wrong either!</i>

19:49.010 --> 19:50.160
<i>So, why?</i>

20:08.690 --> 20:09.900
It was a dream?

20:13.720 --> 20:15.440
<i>That's right.</i>

20:15.800 --> 20:19.170
<i>Sora is going to eat me.</i>

20:20.180 --> 20:23.370
Am I going to die here?

20:32.000 --> 20:34.960
If I am, that's all right.

20:35.980 --> 20:39.080
I'm an unwanted child anyway.

20:53.460 --> 20:54.730
Sora?

20:56.380 --> 20:58.810
My wound healed.

20:58.810 --> 21:00.550
But it was such an awful wound.

21:00.910 --> 21:04.960
Could it be? Sora, did you heal it for me?

21:04.960 --> 21:08.100
You weren't trying to eat me?

21:09.350 --> 21:12.290
You saved me.

21:12.910 --> 21:14.550
Pu, puu.

21:14.550 --> 21:15.550
Huh?

21:15.550 --> 21:17.140
Pu, puu.

21:17.140 --> 21:19.710
Sora talked!

21:19.710 --> 21:21.160
Pu, puu!

21:22.070 --> 21:26.300
Sora talked! I can talk with Sora!

21:26.300 --> 21:27.880
Pu, puu..

21:32.090 --> 21:34.660
Sora, all you can say is "pu, puu"!

21:34.660 --> 21:36.230
Pu, puu.

21:36.640 --> 21:38.990
Sora, thank you.

21:38.990 --> 21:42.070
It's because of you that I survived.

21:42.560 --> 21:46.030
I may be an unwanted child,

21:46.510 --> 21:49.500
but if I'm with you, I don't care about that!

21:49.950 --> 21:51.610
Pu, puu!

22:00.290 --> 22:01.720
Just a little...

22:02.650 --> 22:05.030
Maybe I'll try to live just a little longer.
